# Vercel Blob server uploads.
# Current Vercel-connected stores use OIDC by default:
# - BLOB_STORE_ID is added when the Blob store is connected to the project.
# - VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN is populated automatically by Vercel during deployments.
# - BLOB_WEBHOOK_PUBLIC_KEY may appear in the dashboard but is not used by this server upload route.
#
# Optional fallback for local/off-Vercel testing only:
# BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=
BLOB_STORE_ID=
